  "bodyHash": "vHnH1Q74CGk=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HSBvGEX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"273\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fbRzDFgN.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bRzDFgN.png\" width=\"946\" height=\"480\"></span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">重要通知：</span>&nbsp;自適用於 Minecraft 1.14.4 的 2.0.0 版本起，Unity 已改為模組化形式。原版 Minecraft 的支援將與模組支援、光影紋理貼圖以及用於 Optifine 的隨機實體/CTM 分開。Unity: Modded 可於此處下載：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unity-modded\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>。Unity: Texture Maps 可於此處下載：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unity-shader-support-for-seus-ptgi\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>。隨機實體與 CTM 可於此處下載：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unity-extras\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>也請看看全新的 Unity: 黑暗版 -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unity-dark-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unity-dark-edition</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Unity PBR 現已推出！</span>使用光影與 PPR 來強化你的資源包：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unity-pbr\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unity-pbr</a></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Unity 資源包遵循傳統的 Minecraft 美學，但增添了細膩的層次與更自然的色彩。模組紋理以適用於原版 Minecraft 的 Unity 資源包為基礎進行重新紋理化，並融入獨特的設計特徵，以忠於原始風格。理念是讓作者的原創願景得以保存並發揚... 只是包裝得更精美一些。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TM9Qxoi.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1yIBAii.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Iw9O2o5.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ap3clH3.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EXza3tP.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JtPt9kw.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8EOPd5v.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HvFCkxW.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fJQJfL7E.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sxCLSxx.png\" alt=\"原版總覽\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>重新紋理化原版 Minecraft 的原因純粹是我覺得它在視覺上已落後於現今的模組。此專案的目標是建立一個共同基礎：修飾原版紋理、統一模組紋理，同時保留模組的獨特性。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">建議請提交至 Github（點擊上方「來源」標籤或點擊<a href=\"https://github.com/Unity-Resource-Pack/Unity/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=suggestion&amp;template=suggestion.md&amp;title=Suggestion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>）。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">最新「開發中」版本可在 GitHub 上找到：</strong></p>\n<p><strong style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><br></strong><a href=\"https://github.com/Unity-Resource-Pack/Unity/actions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Unity-Resource-Pack/Unity/workflows/ZIP/badge.svg?branch=1.16\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\"></strong></a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
